:''Not to be confused with [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]].''
'''Ancient Egg: N006''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Empress' Excavation 5]]. It was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

