==Trivia==
*Devil Egg: N006's English description states that the egg has a dark purple shell, but the egg in-game is colored dark blue.
*Fallen Bear Cat has the same black streaks on its face visible on most of the [[:Category:Brainwashed Cats|Brainwashed Cats]].
*The name of the horror movie in Fallen Bear Cat's Japanese description, Akkuma no Sumu Ie (アックマの棲む家, "The House in Which [[Fallen Bear|Akkuma]] Dwells"), is a pun on ''Akuma no Sumu Ie'' (悪魔の棲む家, "The House in Which Devils Dwell"), the Japanese name of the horror movie ''[[wikipedia:The Amityville Horror (1979 film)|The Amityville Horror]]''.

